#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
switch-api — Unified API provider switcher (DuckCoding ↔ Quotio)

Supported targets:
- all (full switch)
- cc
- openclaw
- codex
- droid

Command categories:
1) Status:
   switch-api status
2) Full switch:
   switch-api duck
   switch-api quotio
   switch-api all duck
   switch-api all quotio
3) Single tool switch:
   switch-api cc duck
   switch-api openclaw quotio
   switch-api codex duck
   switch-api droid quotio
"""

